01:08:14,117 --> 01:08:20,117
Men, Women & Children is a 2014 American comedy-drama film directed by Jason Reitman and co-written with Erin Cressida
Wilson, based on a novel of the same name written by Chad Kultgen that deals with online addiction.

11
01:15:03,529 --> 01:15:09,529
The film stars Rosemarie DeWitt, Jennifer Garner, Judy Greer, Dean Norris, Adam Sandler,
Ansel Elgort, Kaitlyn Dever, and Timothée Chalamet in his film debut.

12
01:21:52,941 --> 01:21:58,941
The film premiered at the 2014 Toronto International
Film Festival on September 6, 2014.

13
01:28:42,352 --> 01:28:48,352
The film was released on October 3, 2014, by Paramount Pictures, and
received generally negative reviews from critics.

14
